- instant-character: retry up to 2× with 90s timeout each (was 45s,
  1 attempt — too aggressive, caused most FLUX fallbacks)
- Script prompt: emotional podcast-confession style, 30-45 words,
  intimate/vulnerable, not sales-pitch; 5 distinct emotional angles

static/index.html:
- Portrait grid: querySelector('#portraitStandardMode .p-grid') to
  target visible grid — there are 2 elements with id=portraitGrid,
  getElementById was hitting the hidden LoRA-manual-mode one
- Scene step: "Skip scene → generate with portrait only" ghost button
  so scene is fully optional without blocking

