Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

instant-character was stalling for 5+ minutes before timing out.
PuLID (fal-ai/pulid) is the proven face-consistency model — faster,
stable, designed exactly for locked-identity portrait generation.

Params: face_image_url (not image_url), style_strength=20 (face fidelity
priority), num_inference_steps=20. Result shape handled for both images[]
and image{} response formats.

